<Base title="Privacy: Local Chatbot Builders" description="Privacy information for the Local Chatbot Builders website: this static site sets no accounts or forms and currently collects no personal data itself." path="privacy/">
  <section class="hero"><div class="wrap"><span class="eyebrow">Privacy</span><h1>Privacy</h1></div></section>
  <div class="wrap"><div class="prose">
    <p>This website is a static site. It has no accounts, no contact form and no analytics set up at the time of writing, and it does not itself collect personal data.</p>
    <p>The site is hosted on GitHub Pages, which may log visits under its own terms.</p>
    <h2>Chatbots we build</h2>
    <p>A chatbot we set up for a business collects the enquiry details that business chooses. That business is responsible for how it uses them. Visitors should avoid sharing sensitive details, such as health information, in a chat. When enquiries open, this page will be updated to describe how enquiry details are handled.</p>
    <p>Last updated 20 Nov 2026.</p>
  </div></div>
</Base>
